msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario9:scenario9_AA49492A_FB24_4BEB_8A11_1B6DE71754A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9ed5e91559e1a6d9e58f28ab8154d650877b5e10de96f1744dab9fb1bd837d2
#. default-sha256: e5a2471689ed11548f8f4f542decb0dfff0d98d1c29bea9233acb45b259afe36
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_AA49492A_FB24_4BEB_8A11_1B6DE71754A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In a world where I was never meant to exist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Em um mundo onde eu nunca deveria ter existido."

#: scenario9:scenario9_82D5CD06_EFF9_4E8C_BF26_7855E821AEAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c28fdbff3629be97fd72ea91eff4b35b2878d30804f96841a9043ca76af633e
#. default-sha256: e5c29a1dbf176372dcbad112ed5587355a520eedf10dc23c4b887846fc4bf57b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_82D5CD06_EFF9_4E8C_BF26_7855E821AEAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and Morgana wished to curse the three men’s souls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e Morgana desejou amaldiçoar as almas dos três homens."

#: scenario9:scenario9_D3FF89B2_C0DD_42E7_9E15_DDDEC5A0FD03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d69771167a82dcaf512b8cf855eba6f58c83a531b0d48f9d9ce7723f9055f2bc
#. default-sha256: 6ba7fedd1fa6d504aa2f2613826b3a53e0247325937d6fa8e2d91211bd1ed9b8
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D3FF89B2_C0DD_42E7_9E15_DDDEC5A0FD03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In order for an incomplete soul like mine to survive, it needs something to bind itself to "
"the world—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫something strong enough to prevent the universe from “correcting” the anomaly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Para que uma alma incompleta como a minha sobreviva, ela precisa de algo que a prenda ao "
"mundo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫algo forte o suficiente para impedir o universo de “corrigir” a anomalia."

#: scenario9:scenario9_26C22C6F_3835_4C3F_BA35_F932EDDE9DE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 995bb04bb6382271ee7967e8b5ffc52e216b3634999670b243d59b40225fc15c
#. default-sha256: 32bae73a7933a1c049d5e6c16181d0936f4ebfc228987401c364c1fb873aabb7
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_26C22C6F_3835_4C3F_BA35_F932EDDE9DE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so the wish of that anomaly... ⟪k:1⟫gave birth to yet another anomaly—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E assim o desejo daquela anomalia... ⟪k:1⟫deu à luz a ainda outra anomalia—"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D21274E5_3971_4179_BCFE_1CCDE07DEAD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fb4f093655f3e6ec11941fc4b0e3d0ab28b17c4be99f66a055b95bb2627dd39
#. default-sha256: 68bca67f32ee60d357aa567bc781b143bec4d9703426b17ff25faaa227b0ec11
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D21274E5_3971_4179_BCFE_1CCDE07DEAD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫a house that sat outside the currents of time.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫One that could descend into the "
"mortal realm at various times and places."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫uma casa que ficava fora das correntes do tempo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uma que poderia descer ao reino "
"mortal em vários momentos e lugares."

#: scenario9:scenario9_7B0EB139_01EE_4014_9911_2C1CB1F186DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48671e7c08f18872e46552d497299cb0e28c0dedf3f4163cf457fbc890a897dd
#. default-sha256: d567a5de3c1a19281ee08b379b96b5926c642a250198cfe2b59818b37463fb47
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7B0EB139_01EE_4014_9911_2C1CB1F186DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And why did it have to be that house that bound me to the world?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E por que tinha que ser aquela casa que me prendeu ao mundo?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_A9956F34_AC58_4FD8_AAB2_17ADFA21C0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ea9a11f52aac864c0c4dcde8247b50df9edc6ca55f284bcdb8dd80e7eb1a6
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_A9956F34_AC58_4FD8_AAB2_17ADFA21C0EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario9:scenario9_3D76D3F0_B785_4847_BC7D_4F8DC241C59C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4db29ff02ff197d4cedc6c457c641c9bfa29ebb5d5fa707a3dcc26810c6f991e
#. default-sha256: f09b3d88ab9f355318e3f0c6a3d99486754507faf972e92a2cd887f57118881f
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3D76D3F0_B785_4847_BC7D_4F8DC241C59C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My very presence malevolent."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Minha própria presença malévola."

#: scenario9:scenario9_77583269_3E0D_416C_A4DD_9CEC53949443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf6c0588d6f0718d9b6256925d1484eced0afbec0f46cc46f5a128801d417658
#. default-sha256: 897fe8e7b3571fa43ff29f822de08780645d210dd724c1377904b586a5732484
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_77583269_3E0D_416C_A4DD_9CEC53949443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, stop..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por favor, pare..."

#: scenario9:scenario9_4FA002B7_F14F_45BB_A19E_6A99E0CF9FDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 046ea2608e639bf035a9997e23c548768a1e5e8d77703378ae83f795ec71b596
#. default-sha256: d600c0c36e6e64b73c3a3c28456d5b7dca6702897b496d83a1d92eac56fa176d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4FA002B7_F14F_45BB_A19E_6A99E0CF9FDA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The universe must be returned to its proper state, Michel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O universo deve retornar ao seu estado adequado, Michel."

#: scenario9:scenario9_4DECEAE2_970C_4CD6_BDDF_DE47457B4E9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44745c032f2920a7a1ddddcb752f5a32c2c20cea0906719e082ae068de69366f
#. default-sha256: baa2610c6edc93f8aa6afbbc913c6a48be37eba21fdd5326242b557a5f90aaba
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4DECEAE2_970C_4CD6_BDDF_DE47457B4E9A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t talk about yourself like that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não fale assim de si mesma..."

#: scenario9:scenario9_A9F321DC_32EA_49D0_A6B0_F157BEECC80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76cd3978067062f9c0905a8ce7e4a39299f010fbe0bfd90223525ad0b3df204c
#. default-sha256: e867e82f0d2e3ba35775cfddd3156d3103a7f226a76c730adbced556390962e0
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_A9F321DC_32EA_49D0_A6B0_F157BEECC80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps she will be a butterfly resting upon the lip of a flower.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps she will "
"be that flower.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Perhaps she will be the breeze in which that flower sways."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Talvez ela será uma borboleta pousada na pétala de uma flor.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Talvez ela seja essa "
"flor.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Talvez ela seja a brisa na qual essa flor balança."

#: scenario9:scenario9_1C6A17CD_B342_4017_A559_92CCFEA5C536
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
